der to be destroyed and free all its resources when the player activity is destroyed, but not when it's just backgrounded. We need to keep state for the IMA SDK in memory while in the background so that it's possible to resume ad playback. Are you seeing that IMA objects have leaked after the player activity's `onDestroy` lifecycle method has been called?\r\n\r\nI understand that you're not using the ExoPlayer IMA extension in your app, but this is just a way to reproduce the issue. Are you seeing that objects have leaked after calling `AdsManager.destroy` in your own integration?\r\n\r\nMaybe related: we have seen an issue where IMA leaks its `WebView` when playing an expired ad tag even if the ads manager is destroyed [internal reference: b/64388488]. But if your ad tag hasn't expired this shouldn't apply.","author_association":"COLLABORATOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/google/ExoPlayer/issues/comments/381960130/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"andrewlewis","id":107897,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwNzg5Nw==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/107897?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/andrewlewis","html_url":"https://github.com/andrewlewis","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andrewlewis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andrewlewis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andrewlewis/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andrewlewis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andrewlewis/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andrewlewis/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andrewlewis/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andrewlewis/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andrewle